\newlabel{fig:ladder}{{2}{3}{The complete ladder at a matched budget, by tier. Conditioning helps five rungs (largest: Hotelling $T^2$, $0.06 \to 1.00$), leaves five at ceiling, and hurts two, both boundary-shaped learned novelty models. BOCPD detects nothing on either arm (gradual ramps against an abrupt-change model); ADWIN's integer statistic leaves it only $d{+}1$ operating points}{figure.2}{}}
